{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Lexilo 是一款把學習時遇到的詞彙與表達方式整理成個人收藏的單字學習 App，適合正在學外語、需要自訂詞彙表的學生與自學者。用家可為不同主題、課堂、旅程或個人目標建立清單，並為每個項目加入翻譯、解釋或用法備註。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂清單配合間隔重複複習</h2>\n<p>Lexilo 讓你把課堂、書本或對話中的字詞存進自訂清單，附上翻譯、解釋與用法備註，理解語境而非死記。學習時可用單字卡與聽寫練習，間隔重複會在適當時機重現項目，加深長期記憶；聆聽訓練支援正常或較慢語速並可核對答案，另設進度與連續學習日數追蹤、多種學習語言及 iCloud 同步。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-361-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-362-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-363-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-364-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-365-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Lexilo</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T17:34:37.890355+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":321,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}